#. module: om_account_accountant
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:om_account_accountant.action_account_account_tag
msgid ""
"Tags group accounts or tax lines in the reports, such as the cash flow "
"statement or the tax grids."
msgstr ""
"Les étiquettes regroupent des comptes ou des lignes de taxe dans les "
"rapports, comme le tableau des flux de trésorerie ou les grilles de taxes."

#. module: om_account_accountant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_account_accountant.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"The accounting managers can still post it: the override is logged on the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"Les responsables comptables peuvent quand même la comptabiliser : le "
"dépassement est consigné sur la facture."

#. module: om_account_accountant
